<title>UK: BOE invites fixed rate operations,shortage 700 mln.</title>
<headline>BOE invites fixed rate operations,shortage 700 mln.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England revised its liquidity shortage forecast to 700 million stg from the previous 750 million and invited a round of fixed rate operations.</p>
</text>
